{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737550/extras/c0077a8579ecc93fcb32531e997cc6fc.avif?t=1768393930\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for the perfect bottom-of-screen idle game to keep you entertained while you work? Spin Royale is here to spin and earn money automatically, all while you focus on other tasks. In Spin Royale, your slot machine spins automatically, generating money while you focus on other tasks. Unlike other slot-based games, this is an endless progression experience \u2013 climb the global leaderboard and amass your fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737550/extras/b42875290d0677870633ceeddc89ad27.poster.avif?t=1768393930\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737550/extras/b42875290d0677870633ceeddc89ad27.webm?t=1768393930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737550/extras/b42875290d0677870633ceeddc89ad27.mp4?t=1768393930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737550/extras/e52b9dbaeb2145b05b4da2c50e61b92b.avif?t=1768393930\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Gameplay:</strong> Let the slot machine spin while you work, study, or relax.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Progression:</strong> No quick resets. Keep building your empire indefinitely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute